<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Electronics for Imaging.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Electronics for Imaging.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson Stephens &amp; Co analyst John Rossi raised his fiscal year 1997 earnings per share estimate from $1.63 per share to $1.68 and his fiscal year 1998 estimate from $2.05 to $2.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- Rossi cited strong Q2 results.</p>
